The Hero, Content Row, Carousel, Gallery, Callout and Audio blocks now keep the classes Volto gives every block (styles, and Volto Light Theme's classes for the neighbouring blocks such as `previous--has--same--backgroundColor`). They replaced them with their own, so Volto Light Theme's spacing between neighbouring blocks never applied to them. The Hero and Content Row also no longer get the gap every block gets below it (Volto Light Theme's 25px, Volto's 1em) on top of their own space above and below: the editor's choice is the whole gap, and with "None" two of them touch. Text right below them keeps the gap. This changes the spacing around these blocks on existing pages.
